WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:08.074
Without regaining his memory,
Mr. Albert left with no trace.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.277
Candy was very worried about this.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.142
The two made a deal not to part again

00:00:12.342 --> 00:00:16.982
until he will regain his memory.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:23.481
A small castle in the outskirts

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.893
What kind of room do you want?

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.462
A quiet one.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:46.877
It's ok if it's a little noisy,
as long as it's cheap.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.945
The room doesn't have to be big.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.054
No way!

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.221
But...

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:58.887
I would like to rent a place
like this, too.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.996
How can you treat a customer like this?

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:04.497
What kind of customer are you?

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.896
You have no money,
but you want to rent a good house.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.092
Welcome!

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:16.267
Would you like to rent a house?
Please have a seat.

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:29.418
No money, no service.
What kind of attitude is this?

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.291
Candy.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.764
You must have been turned down again.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:45.768
Yes, but...
We will surely find one today!

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.664
Chicago is a big city.

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:50.844
Don't worry, Mr. Albert.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:54.107
I will find you a house.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.381
"For rent".

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:30.216
It's so quiet here!

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.807
- But...
- Wait for me.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:46.558
It's been empty for a while,
so it's a little dirty.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.102
Excuse me...

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:50.503
You don't like it?

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:52.806
You brought me here...

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:55.773
Does this mean
I can rent the house from you?

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:57.644
You don't want to?

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.477
I want to.

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:14.018
This is the kitchen!

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.124
And the bathroom!

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:21.197
The bedroom is here.
There is one more room there.

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:23.326
Great!

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:24.971
Are you happy with this place?

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.406
Yes.

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:28.997
But, as I said before...

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:31.144
The rent is settled.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:33.847
You don't have to pay any extra.

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:35.915
Thank you!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.742
Mr. Albert!

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.221
Mr. Albert!

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.281
We got the house!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.162
You are not living alone?

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:50.964
I'll live with him.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.157
- Are you siblings?
- We are friends.

00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:57.670
Friends? You...

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.975
He is my patient.

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:04.811
A patient causes too much trouble.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.080
No. He just lost his memory.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:12.812
He can't even remember his own name.

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:15.887
I am so envious of him!

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:17.624
Mr. Thomas...

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:20.894
I wish I could forget
about the past, too.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:24.130
Including you wanting to rent the house.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.338
Aren't you going to let me the house?

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:30.570
You are not siblings, nor a couple.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:31.971
How embarrassing!

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.973
You misunderstood, Mr. Albert and I...

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.308
Leave!

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:38.569
I was being sympathetic
to your situation.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:13.880
Are you tired, Candy?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.882
No. You are the one to be tired.

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:19.019
You are not recovered yet.

00:05:19.219 --> 00:05:22.022
No, you make me feel better.

00:05:22.222 --> 00:05:23.690
You lift me up.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:26.459
Are you hungry, Mr. Albert?

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:28.962
You should go back to the hospital.

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:32.429
I have to get you settled first.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:34.668
It's strange.

00:05:34.868 --> 00:05:36.136
What is it?

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:38.238
I was thinking...

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:42.741
Wandering in the streets
would make most people anxious.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.947
But I feel optimistic.

00:05:47.147 --> 00:05:48.648
Maybe you are right

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:53.411
and I was used living outside,
under the stars.

00:05:56.056 --> 00:05:58.091
Right, Mr. Albert.

00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.455
You like the nature and animals.

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:04.954
You often spent the night outside.

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:08.268
Let's spend the night
in the park tonight.

00:06:08.468 --> 00:06:09.669
No, Candy!

00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:11.504
Looking at the stars in the sky

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:14.266
may help you remember something.

00:06:19.412 --> 00:06:21.004
Hey, mister!

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:25.851
Dating with the young lady, are we?

00:06:31.357 --> 00:06:33.927
Stop! He is my patient.

00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:37.355
Patient? Are you joking with me?

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:39.394
Give me your money!

00:06:41.835 --> 00:06:43.770
Too bad, I have nothing.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.331
Bastard!

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.277
Damn!

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:58.385
So great!

00:06:58.585 --> 00:07:01.821
I remember when Mr. Albert
was in London...

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:04.891
Terry was drunk and got into trouble.

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:07.357
Mr. Albert saved him once.

00:07:12.732 --> 00:07:16.463
Mr. Albert, do you remember Terry?

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:17.727
Terry...

00:07:18.071 --> 00:07:21.006
Yes, Terry! Do you emember anything?

00:07:27.994 --> 00:07:29.181
Run!

00:07:29.883 --> 00:07:31.951
Don't go!
He is remembering something!

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:33.575
Are you kidding?

00:07:37.157 --> 00:07:39.325
I will give you something in return!

00:07:39.525 --> 00:07:41.325
Let's run!

00:07:45.732 --> 00:07:47.165
Terry.

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:53.000
Yes! Terry often visited you
in the zoo.

00:07:59.779 --> 00:08:01.644
No, I can't remember anything.

00:08:03.082 --> 00:08:06.218
Take it easy, Mr. Albert.

00:08:13.359 --> 00:08:14.961
Candy!

00:08:15.161 --> 00:08:16.563
Stear! Archie!

00:08:16.763 --> 00:08:18.763
We have been looking for you.

00:08:19.632 --> 00:08:21.835
We found a good house, Candy!

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:23.436
Really?

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:25.205
Come, get on!

00:08:25.405 --> 00:08:26.670
Thanks.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.876
We're here.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.412
Second floor.

00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:49.129
Archie, here...

00:08:49.329 --> 00:08:51.113
The landlord turned you down?

00:08:51.313 --> 00:08:53.731
We then found this house.

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:00.504
Mr. Thomas.

00:09:01.507 --> 00:09:05.545
So he lost his memory in Italy.

00:09:05.745 --> 00:09:08.136
I couldn't say no.

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:12.452
My daughter married an Italian.

00:09:12.652 --> 00:09:15.049
I am worried about the war in Europe.

00:09:15.249 --> 00:09:16.950
Your daughter...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.754
I hope she is fine and safe.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:21.761
Here is the key.

00:09:21.961 --> 00:09:24.056
Thank you, Mr. Thomas!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.275
Archie, is it alright?

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:35.941
Are all the luggages here?

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:40.102
Can your car load a lot?

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:42.941
Brother would have had problem
carrying them anyway.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:45.481
What are you talking about, Archie?

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:49.722
Candy, Dr. Leonard is looking for you.

00:09:49.922 --> 00:09:51.084
Thanks.

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:56.396
You are moving out of the dormitory?

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:59.599
Yes, the Senior Nurse has agreed.

00:09:59.799 --> 00:10:03.100
Are you moving in with patient
from ward No. 0?

00:10:03.436 --> 00:10:06.206
If you want to take care of him,
that's your choice.

00:10:06.406 --> 00:10:09.002
But it's a different matter
if you live with him.

00:10:09.242 --> 00:10:11.972
It might distract the other nurses.

00:10:12.512 --> 00:10:14.347
If I tell the truth,

00:10:14.547 --> 00:10:16.805
he won't let me take care
of Mr. Albert.

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:19.444
Answer me, Candice!

00:10:20.687 --> 00:10:22.154
We are not living together.

00:10:41.774 --> 00:10:44.140
I lied to the doctor

00:10:44.477 --> 00:10:48.379
because I want Mr. Albert to recover.

00:10:52.785 --> 00:10:55.515
Welcome, Candy! It's all cleaned up.

00:10:56.155 --> 00:10:57.588
Thank you for doing this.

00:10:59.359 --> 00:11:01.190
It looks like a different house!

00:11:02.428 --> 00:11:04.988
Annie and Archie helped a lot.

00:11:05.798 --> 00:11:06.899
Thank you, Annie!

00:11:07.099 --> 00:11:08.523
You're welcome.

00:11:09.302 --> 00:11:11.804
Candy, leave it to the guys.

00:11:12.004 --> 00:11:13.706
Let's go prepare dinner.

00:11:13.906 --> 00:11:16.168
Ok, watch me do the show!

00:11:17.744 --> 00:11:18.852
Candy, you are cooking?

00:11:19.012 --> 00:11:23.205
Don't worry,
I have the medicine ready.

00:11:26.452 --> 00:11:28.388
You are really a nurse.

00:11:28.788 --> 00:11:31.919
Tying a vegetable is harder
than wrapping a bandage.

00:11:35.094 --> 00:11:37.688
You are trying too hard.

00:11:41.601 --> 00:11:43.703
I'll go boil the water.

00:11:48.074 --> 00:11:49.132
Candy.

00:11:49.909 --> 00:11:52.245
Maybe I am too nosy.

00:11:52.445 --> 00:11:55.445
This thing,
you'd better not tell Terry.

00:11:56.549 --> 00:11:57.982
Why?

00:11:58.484 --> 00:12:02.622
If I were Terry, I would be upset.

00:12:02.822 --> 00:12:05.384
Because I live with Mr. Albert?

00:12:06.959 --> 00:12:12.632
Mr. Thomas and Dr. Leonard think the same.

00:12:12.832 --> 00:12:15.101
People might take it wrong easily.

00:12:15.301 --> 00:12:17.670
Thank you for your advice, Annie.

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:19.863
Then, Terry...

00:12:20.106 --> 00:12:22.040
I don't want to lie to him.

00:12:22.241 --> 00:12:23.376
Candy...

00:12:23.576 --> 00:12:27.313
Telling the truth is the only way
to avoid misunderstandings.

00:12:27.513 --> 00:12:31.076
Besides, I don't want
to hide anything from Terry.

00:12:31.551 --> 00:12:34.053
Yes, you are right.

00:12:34.453 --> 00:12:36.753
I am too nosy.

00:12:38.324 --> 00:12:40.626
It's good that you reminded me,

00:12:40.826 --> 00:12:43.388
otherwise I'd tried
to hide this thing from Terry.

00:12:44.797 --> 00:12:46.856
Oh! No!

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.341
Miss Susanna!

00:13:12.541 --> 00:13:13.823
Nice to see you.

00:13:14.994 --> 00:13:19.055
You came to see Terry?
He is not up yet.

00:13:19.665 --> 00:13:20.833
Let me wake him up.

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:23.458
No, madam, let me.

00:13:23.836 --> 00:13:26.964
Alright, please give this letter to him.

00:13:33.679 --> 00:13:35.408
Candice White.

00:13:35.848 --> 00:13:38.214
That girl from Chicago!

00:13:49.395 --> 00:13:50.685
The door is not locked.

00:13:52.465 --> 00:13:53.898
Good morning, Terry.

00:13:56.035 --> 00:13:58.003
Susanna, what are you here for?

00:13:58.304 --> 00:14:00.329
We can go to the rehearsal together.

00:14:00.873 --> 00:14:04.775
Susanna, I am not in kindergarten.

00:14:05.111 --> 00:14:06.510
Terry...

00:14:06.846 --> 00:14:09.782
You don't have to pick me up,
I can go by myself.

00:14:09.982 --> 00:14:11.543
You go first.

00:14:13.452 --> 00:14:14.587
Terry...

00:14:14.787 --> 00:14:18.157
If the person standing here was her,

00:14:18.357 --> 00:14:20.191
your attitude
would be completely different.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.491
I am going first.

00:14:40.079 --> 00:14:41.303
I am back.

00:14:42.415 --> 00:14:43.316
Welcome.

00:14:43.516 --> 00:14:45.751
I'll make dinner right now.

00:14:45.951 --> 00:14:47.478
There was an emergency patient...

00:14:55.394 --> 00:14:57.611
Mr. Albert, this...

00:14:57.811 --> 00:15:00.632
I didn't have anything to do,
so I tried to cook something.

00:15:00.832 --> 00:15:03.166
And the dishes all got done.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.740
You always did things alone.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.646
When you were cooking,
did you remember anything?

00:15:16.082 --> 00:15:17.750
It's ok, Mr. Albert.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:21.521
The detail things in daily life

00:15:21.721 --> 00:15:24.054
can help you with your memory.

00:15:25.491 --> 00:15:29.662
I feel the puzzle in my heart
is gradually getting away.

00:15:29.862 --> 00:15:32.959
Didn't you have this kind of feeling
in the hospital?

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:37.570
Let's eat! Go wash your hands first.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:38.694
Ok.

00:15:40.573 --> 00:15:42.404
Mr. Albert...

00:15:43.175 --> 00:15:44.733
There is no reply.

00:15:45.211 --> 00:15:46.312
There isn't?

00:15:46.512 --> 00:15:49.682
Candy, are you waiting
for Terry's letter?

00:15:49.882 --> 00:15:51.684
Terry?

00:15:51.884 --> 00:15:53.853
Do you remember Terry?

00:15:54.253 --> 00:15:58.190
No. You often mention this name.

00:15:59.425 --> 00:16:00.949
I...

00:16:13.339 --> 00:16:15.671
The poster for the show this time.

00:16:17.543 --> 00:16:19.067
It's so pretty!

00:16:19.912 --> 00:16:21.675
It's a month before the show.

00:16:22.014 --> 00:16:25.040
Everyone,
try your best to complete the show.

00:16:25.484 --> 00:16:27.577
Good luck, Terry!

00:16:29.021 --> 00:16:29.921
Terry...

00:16:33.492 --> 00:16:35.227
I play Romeo.

00:16:35.427 --> 00:16:36.988
What would Candy think about that?

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:40.158
He must be still thinking about her.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.128
The practice starts at one o'clock
in the afternoon.

00:16:51.143 --> 00:16:52.974
I want to send Candy an invitation.

00:16:53.512 --> 00:16:55.872
And a train ticket to New York.

00:16:56.649 --> 00:17:00.517
One way only.
I don't want her to go back.

00:17:05.758 --> 00:17:06.859
Susanna.

00:17:07.259 --> 00:17:11.289
Terry, in the scene we just rehearsed...

00:17:12.098 --> 00:17:16.802
I think the time we stare at each other
with tenderness and love should be longer.

00:17:17.002 --> 00:17:19.105
You came to see me for this?

00:17:19.305 --> 00:17:20.873
No.

00:17:21.073 --> 00:17:23.373
Then what is it?

00:17:23.576 --> 00:17:27.046
At first, I wanted to tear it off.

00:17:27.246 --> 00:17:28.977
Tear it off?

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:33.019
But I can't bear to see you sad.

00:17:33.219 --> 00:17:35.087
Take it back.

00:17:36.021 --> 00:17:37.923
This is from Candy!

00:17:38.123 --> 00:17:39.458
Sorry!

00:17:39.658 --> 00:17:40.666
Susanna!

00:17:54.707 --> 00:17:56.436
- Thank you for doing this.
- Good-bye.

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.007
Mr. Albert...

00:18:03.215 --> 00:18:04.717
Candy.

00:18:04.917 --> 00:18:06.682
Pretend you don't know me.

00:18:06.886 --> 00:18:09.480
Sorry for the trouble I caused, Candy.

00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:28.708
Your letter is here.

00:18:28.908 --> 00:18:31.924
I wanted to make you a surprise.

00:18:32.124 --> 00:18:33.476
Is it from Terry?

00:18:34.013 --> 00:18:36.174
Read it in the park before you go home.

00:18:36.382 --> 00:18:38.684
Thank you, Mr. Albert!

00:18:51.497 --> 00:18:54.166
Candy, what's wrong with you?

00:18:54.366 --> 00:18:55.568
I am your boyfriend

00:18:55.768 --> 00:18:57.870
and you live with Mr. Albert.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:00.336
I can't forgive you,
no matter what the reason is!

00:19:01.907 --> 00:19:03.272
Terry...

00:19:04.243 --> 00:19:05.711
I am just kidding!

00:19:05.911 --> 00:19:07.313
Of course, it would have not been ok
if the person was someone else.

00:19:07.513 --> 00:19:10.314
But it's Mr. Albert!
Of course I am fine with it.

00:19:11.417 --> 00:19:13.885
Naughty Terry!

00:19:18.657 --> 00:19:19.792
Anyway, I think that...

00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:24.197
..you must be tired from taking care
of Mr. Albert without his memory.

00:19:24.697 --> 00:19:25.698
If it would be possible,

00:19:25.898 --> 00:19:28.634
I would like
to share the responsibility with you.

00:19:28.834 --> 00:19:32.363
But the show is going to start soon,
so I can't leave.

00:19:32.972 --> 00:19:36.703
I hope
you can come to see me in the show.

00:19:42.248 --> 00:19:44.016
Terry is the main lead!

00:19:44.216 --> 00:19:47.181
He invited me to go to Broadway.

00:19:47.586 --> 00:19:49.884
I am looking forward to seeing
the Romeo Terry will be playing!

00:19:50.122 --> 00:19:52.818
Mr. Albert will be happy for me.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.359
We have guests?

00:20:07.239 --> 00:20:08.607
Vice principal!

00:20:08.807 --> 00:20:12.337
Candice, did you lie to me?

00:20:13.279 --> 00:20:15.514
Sorry.

00:20:15.714 --> 00:20:18.608
But Mr. Albert is getting well.

00:20:19.785 --> 00:20:21.020
Good.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.756
From now on,
your job is to take care of him.

00:20:23.956 --> 00:20:25.291
My job...

00:20:25.491 --> 00:20:26.992
I am the hospital's administrator.

00:20:27.192 --> 00:20:30.629
I can't just tolerate your behaviour.

00:20:31.629 --> 00:20:34.634
Vice principal, Mr. Albert is a patient.

00:20:35.004 --> 00:20:37.536
From now on,
you don't have to come to the hospital.

00:20:37.736 --> 00:20:41.299
If you move back to the dormitory,
I will reconsider it.

00:20:42.074 --> 00:20:43.666
Vice principal!

00:20:43.876 --> 00:20:44.844
Let's go!

00:20:45.044 --> 00:20:46.138
Please wait!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.039
Wait, Mr. vice principal!

00:20:57.957 --> 00:21:01.154
The carrige is going away.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:04.993
Candy is struggling.

00:21:05.798 --> 00:21:09.564
She can't leave Mr. Albert here
and return to the hospital.

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:14.720
In order not to make Mr. Albert worried,

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:19.503
Candy decided to pretend
that nothing is wrong.
